ALVA — Remove Combat Assist and Combo Assist, Introduce Automatic Turn-Around

Objective

Perform a complete, production-quality refactor of the Alva fighting game.

Repository: hiyroscript/alva
Branch: main

The required changes are:

1. Completely remove Combat Assist from the game.
2. Completely remove Combo Assist from the game.
3. Add a new setting named Automatic turn-around under Settings → Combat.
4. Make Automatic turn-around ON by default for all players, including existing players upgrading from older settings versions.
5. When enabled, automatically orient the human player’s fighter toward the closest valid enemy.
6. When disabled, restore Alva’s existing manual-facing behavior exactly.
7. Preserve every other existing gameplay mechanic.

This must be a real engine-level implementation, not simply a settings-menu redesign.

Do not introduce temporary compatibility systems, disabled versions of the previous assists, unused configuration options, or hidden residual behavior.

