That entire functionality must be removed.

Remove the gameplay implementation

Delete:

js/game/combat/combat-assist.js

Remove all Combat Assist-specific imports, properties, methods, calculations, and execution paths from Fighter.

This includes, where present:

* combatAssist
* combatAssistOn
* combatAssistFor
