In particular, remove the special movement-trail condition associated with fighter.combatAssist without affecting ordinary Dash trails.

Remove attack properties such as assist-specific toward and turnHold where they no longer serve any independent gameplay purpose.

Do not remove legitimate movement, attack-cancellation, or projectile mechanics.

